sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant T as TasksTab
    participant SD as SpeedDial
    participant CD as ConfirmDialog
    participant Store as TaskStore
    participant Rem as ReminderService

    Note over User,T: 录入入口（R1 / 决策B1）：单加号 FAB
    User->>T: 点击「+」FAB
    T->>SD: onToggle(open=true)
    SD-->>User: 展开 [手动录入][语音录入]
    User->>SD: 点击「手动录入」
    SD->>T: onAdd()
    T->>T: push(AddTaskScreen)
    Note over User,T: 点击「语音录入」→ onVoice() → push(VoiceInputScreen)

    Note over User,T: 居中滑动筛选（R2）
    User->>T: 左右滑动/点 Tab
    T->>T: _tabController.index → _filter
    T->>Store: Consumer 重算 _sortedFiltered

    Note over User,T: 清空已完成（R5 / 决策A）
    User->>T: 点击垃圾桶图标
    T->>CD: show(破坏性确认)
    CD-->>User: AlertDialog(AppTheme.danger 确认按钮)
    alt 用户取消
        User->>CD: 取消
        CD-->>T: false
        Note over T: 无操作
    else 用户确认
        User->>CD: 确认清空
        CD-->>T: true
        T->>Store: all.where(status == done)
        loop 每个已完成任务 t
            T->>Rem: cancelTask(t)
            T->>Store: delete(t)
        end
        Store-->>T: notifyListeners()
        T-->>User: 列表刷新，已完成已清空
    end
